      "startup_focus": "C — The site labels itself as startup-focused but serves large public companies equally. The 'companies/startups' page is a curated list, not all are actively hiring on the job board.",
      "ease_of_scraping": "D — Heavy JavaScript rendering; initial HTML payloads contain limited data. Server-side rendered pages (builtinseattle.com) return more content. Filters are client-side and don't always reflect in URL params.",
